ield}` must be in the range 0.0..=24.0, got {value}\")]\n    57→    HoursOutOfRange { field: &'static str, value: f64 },\n    58→    #[error(\"field `{field}` must be above 0.0 C, got {value}\")]\n    59→    TemperatureTooLow { field: &'static str, value: f64 },\n    60→    #[error(\"source profile id must not be empty\")]\n    61→    EmptySourceProfileId,\n    62→    #[error(\"invariant violation for `{field}` with value {value}\")]\n    63→    InvariantViolation { field: &'static str, value: f64 },\n    64→    #[error(\"unknown source water profile: `{id}`\")]\n    65→    UnknownSourceProfile { id: String },\n    66→    #[error(\"invalid source water profile `{id}`: field `{field}` has invalid value {value}\")]\n    67→    InvalidSourceProfile {\n    68→        id: String,\n    69→        field: &'static str,\n    70→        value: f64,\n    71→    },\n    72→    #[error(\"schema version mismatch: expected {expected}, got {actual}\")]\n    73→    SchemaVersionMismatch { expected: u32, actual: u32 },\n    74→    #[error(\"serialization error: {0}\")]\n    75→    Serialization(String),\n    76→    #[error(\"deserialization error: {0}\")]\n    77→    Deserialization(String),\n    78→}\n    79→\n    80→impl PlayerAction {\n    81→    pub fn validate(&self) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n    82→        match self {\n    83→            Self::Feed { grams } => validate_non_negative(\"grams\", *grams),\n    84→            Self::WaterChangePercent {\n    85→                percent,\n    86→                source_profile_id,\n    87→            } => {\n    88→                validate_percent(\"percent\", *percent)?;\n    89→                if source_profile_id.trim().is_empty() {\n    90→                    Err(SimError::EmptySourceProfileId)\n    91→                } else {\n    92→                    Ok(())\n    93→                }\n    94→            }\n    95→            Self::TrimPlants { fraction }\n    96→            | Self::SiphonDetritus { fraction }\n    97→            | Self::CleanFilter {\n    98→                intensity: fraction,\n    99→            } => validate_fraction(field_name(self), *fraction),\n   100→            Self::AddShrimp { .. } | Self::RemoveShrimp { .. } => Ok(()),\n   101→            Self::ChangePhotoperiod { hours } => {\n   102→                validate_finite(\"hours\", *hours)?;\n   103→                if (0.0..=24.0).contains(hours) {\n   104→                    Ok(())\n   105→                } else {\n   106→                    Err(SimError::HoursOutOfRange {\n   107→                        field: \"hours\",\n   108→                        value: *hours,\n   109→                    })\n   110→                }\n   111→            }\n   112→            Self::ChangeLightIntensity { intensity_index } => {\n   113→                validate_fraction(\"intensity_index\", *intensity_index)\n   114→            }\n   115→            Self::ChangeHeaterSetpoint { setpoint_c } => {\n   116→                validate_temperature(\"setpoint_c\", *setpoint_c)\n   117→            }\n   118→            Self::ChangeAmbientTemperature { target_c } => {\n   119→                validate_temperature(\"target_c\", *target_c)\n   120→            }\n   121→            Self::ChangeAeration { intensity, .. } => validate_fraction(\"intensity\", *intensity),\n   122→        }\n   123→    }\n   124→}\n   125→\n   126→fn field_name(action: &PlayerAction) -> &'static str {\n   127→    match action {\n   128→        PlayerAction::TrimPlants { .. } => \"fraction\",\n   129→        PlayerAction::SiphonDetritus { .. } => \"fraction\",\n   130→        PlayerAction::CleanFilter { .. } => \"intensity\",\n   131→        _ => \"value\",\n   132→    }\n   133→}\n   134→\n   135→fn validate_non_negative(field: &'static str, value: f64) -> Result<(), SimError> {\n   136→    validate_finite(field, value)?;\n   137→    if value < 0.0 {\n   138→        Err(SimError::NegativeValue { field, value })\n   139→    } else {\n   140→        Ok(())\n   141→