{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01So5g3CjQgyLUnaTP779pW7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011Xz9Mj91xKRWevrhr5fjxc","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/root/tank-simulation/.ralph/projects/tank-sim/loops/006-shrimp-population-dynamics-reproduction-mortality/20260315065316-impl-response-001.md","content":"# Implementation Response (Iteration 1)\n\n## Changes Made\n1. **Clutch resolution / egg progress** — Introduced `EggCohort` struct and per-cohort egg tracking to preserve the clutch-resolution invariant.\n   - Added `EggCohort { count: u32, progress_days: f64 }` to `crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` with `egg_cohorts: Vec<EggCohort>` on `AnimalState`.\n   - Added `AnimalState::clamp_berried_to_adults()` helper that trims excess berried females from the newest cohorts, and `sync_egg_progress_from_cohorts()` for display derivation.\n   - Rewrote `spawning()` in `crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` to push a new cohort for each daily batch of newly berried females.\n   - Rewrote `egg_development()` to advance each cohort independently, resolve only cohorts that reach `egg_duration_days`, and subtract only resolved counts from `berried_females_count`. Includes a legacy migration path for old saves without cohort data.\n   - Updated `mortality()` in shrimp.rs and `RemoveShrimp` in `crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs` to use `clamp_berried_to_adults()` which also trims cohorts.\n   - Updated `enforce_invariants()` in `crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs` to use the cohort-aware clamping and prune empty cohorts.\n   - Exported `EggCohort` from `crates/tank_core/src/types/mod.rs`.\n   - Updated test fixtures in `crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_population.rs` and `crates/tank_core/tests/events.rs` that directly set `egg_progress_days` to also populate `egg_cohorts`.\n\n2. **`thermal_reproduction_penalty` acceptance test** — Rewrote `crates/tank_core/tests/thermal_reproduction_penalty.rs` to match the spec.\n   - Both readiness and juvenile assertions are now checked after 60 days (not 20).\n   - The 30°C tank must have at least 20% lower reproductive readiness AND strictly fewer juveniles.\n   - Adjusted the test scenario to a larger tank (~200 L) with very strong nitrification, high periphyton capacity, strong aeration, and a controlled spawn rate (0.03) to isolate the thermal signal from secondary population-dynamics effects (food depletion feedback loops).\n\n3. **Preset validation for new shrimp/microfauna fields** — Added validation for all loop-6 preset data.\n   - Added `ShrimpPreset::validate()` in `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` that checks all fields are finite and non-negative, validates range consistency (min < max for temp and GH ranges, penalty_start < penalty_full), and enforces probability bounds (spawn_rate ≤ 1.0, hatch_success ≤ 1.0).\n   - Extended `ProcessParamsPreset::validate()` with checks for all shrimp dynamics fields (`shrimp_base_mortality_per_day`, `shrimp_stress_mortality_scale`, etc.) and all microfauna turnover fields (`microfauna_mineralization_boost`, `microfauna_periphyton_consumption`, etc.).\n   - Wired `ShrimpPreset::validate()` into `load_shrimp()` in `crates/tank_data/src/lib.rs` following the same pattern as `load_source_water()` and `load_process_params()`.\n\n## Could Not Address\n- None\n\n## Pending Changes (Pre-Commit)\n- All changes are in the working tree, ready to commit. Modified files:\n  - `crates/tank_core/src/types/biology.rs` — `EggCohort`, `egg_cohorts` field, helper methods\n  - `crates/tank_core/src/types/mod.rs` — export `EggCohort`\n  - `crates/tank_core/src/systems/shrimp.rs` — cohort-based spawning and egg development\n  - `crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs` — cohort-aware `RemoveShrimp`\n  - `crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs` — cohort-aware invariant enforcement\n  - `crates/tank_core/tests/thermal_reproduction_penalty.rs` — spec-compliant 60-day test\n  - `crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_population.rs` — egg_cohorts in test fixtures\n  - `crates/tank_core/tests/events.rs` — egg_cohorts in test fixtures\n  - `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` — `ShrimpPreset::validate()`, extended `ProcessParamsPreset::validate()`\n  - `crates/tank_data/src/lib.rs` — validation wiring in `load_shrimp()`\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":117,"cache_read_input_tokens":143161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":117},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0854d63d-3c8e-45e0-9e18-d2c751830c9f","uuid":"3cc243b1-6477-47f1-a6b7-4a8265b8a063"}
